e=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a> 的有限函数序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Suc}:\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\to\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\qquad\\operatorname{Suc}(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle):=\\Delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Suc}:\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\to\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\qquad\\operatorname{Suc}(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle):=\\Delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>LJ的限制是该序列长度≤1；仅这个限制不足以自动给出其完整∨R逻辑规则。有序对的唯一分解直接给出后件函数，不需要另行约定投影从0还是从1编号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$，两侧都是 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]] 的有限函数序列。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Suc}:\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\to\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma,\\qquad\\operatorname{Suc}(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle):=\\Delta.","display":true}],"bytes":1086,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-sequent-succedent|df-sequent-succedent — Sequent Succedent]]"}],"outgoing":["f9452e4a7788a117"]}